WEBVTT

00:03.010 --> 00:05.160
Anri! The magic crystals!

00:05.160 --> 00:06.090
Right!

00:06.650 --> 00:08.800
Weapons... Any weapons?

00:09.800 --> 00:10.990
Here!

00:10.990 --> 00:12.190
Ein Seil!

00:19.850 --> 00:21.680
Ein Fleurety!

00:27.380 --> 00:29.430
<b><i>HE'S DEAD</i></b>

00:39.190 --> 00:40.080
<b>THE</b>

00:40.080 --> 00:40.620
<b>LEGEN</b>

00:40.620 --> 00:41.120
<b>DARY</b>

00:41.120 --> 00:41.580
<b>HERO</b>

00:41.580 --> 00:42.080
<b>IS</b>

00:42.040 --> 00:42.540
<b>DEAD</b>

01:56.550 --> 01:59.550
<b>The Legendary Hero Is a Girl</b>

01:56.550 --> 01:59.550
<b>Episode 6</b>

01:57.300 --> 01:58.980
That knocked the zombies out?

01:59.420 --> 02:02.180
It's not an especially powerful spell.

02:02.180 --> 02:04.480
Is something odd about that?

02:04.480 --> 02:07.290
It means there's no necromancy in play.

02:07.670 --> 02:09.730
Hey, make sure you guys don't get bit!

02:10.160 --> 02:11.690
Sir Touka!

02:12.660 --> 02:16.030
If they bite you, you become 
a monster like them.

02:16.400 --> 02:18.320
What's wrong with Dame Yuna?

02:18.320 --> 02:23.410
Oh, uh, she was hanging out in her undies 
after the bath and got chilly!

02:23.410 --> 02:26.450
Indeed, it would be terrible 
to leave her in that state.

02:26.450 --> 02:31.420
<i>I dunno what'll happen if they find out 
Yuna's turning into a monster...</i>

02:31.810 --> 02:34.380
<i>Don't worry. 
I'll protect you, no matter what!</i>

02:34.380 --> 02:36.670
What do we do next?

02:37.000 --> 02:41.260
If we wish to leave town, it's quite 
a ways to the enchanted carriage.

02:41.260 --> 02:44.260
And there's no guarantee we'll reach it 
without getting bit.

02:45.030 --> 02:47.850
I was planning on staying here anyway.

02:47.850 --> 02:50.520
At least until we find the cause 
of this chaos and resolve it!

02:50.520 --> 02:53.260
Sir Touka! You're taking 
your duties seriously!

02:53.260 --> 02:55.320
You're just like a true legendary hero!

02:55.320 --> 02:58.030
Then we should head to the mayor's mansion.

02:58.030 --> 02:59.970
Survivors are there.

03:01.140 --> 03:02.240
Who are you?

03:03.430 --> 03:04.950
What do we do now?!

03:04.950 --> 03:07.740
Are we all going to be bitten 
and become monsters?

03:07.740 --> 03:09.290
Calm down already!

03:09.460 --> 03:12.750
<b>Dott Burns
Mayor</b>

03:09.800 --> 03:12.750
There's absolutely nothing to worry about!

03:13.230 --> 03:16.050
There's a sturdy wall around this mansion!

03:16.050 --> 03:17.650
No one can get in!

03:17.650 --> 03:18.750
Someone got in!

03:18.750 --> 03:19.920
What?!

03:20.610 --> 03:22.180
Sion the hero!

03:24.720 --> 03:25.770
Mr. Hero!

03:26.310 --> 03:28.940
The legendary hero's come to save us!

03:29.270 --> 03:31.500
What are <i>they</i> doing here?

03:31.500 --> 03:33.230
I thought we'd given them the slip!

03:33.400 --> 03:34.500
Hey, aren't you two...

03:35.960 --> 03:37.080
Just my imagination.

03:39.160 --> 03:41.340
Th-That woman...

03:44.230 --> 03:48.630
Your lady friend there seems 
a bit under the weather.

03:48.630 --> 03:51.840
She didn't... get <i>bit</i>, did she?

03:52.210 --> 03:55.670
Maybe we should check. Just to be sure.

03:55.670 --> 03:58.050
Sh-She's just caught a cold!

03:58.050 --> 04:00.430
She hasn't been bitten! 
You don't need to check!

04:00.430 --> 04:01.880
Judging by your reaction...

04:01.880 --> 04:03.300
She's infected, right?

04:04.260 --> 04:08.580
We can't give anyone special treatment,
not even a companion of the hero!

04:08.580 --> 04:13.140
Anyone bitten needs to die,
or they'll put us all in danger!

04:13.140 --> 04:14.590
He's right! Kill her!

04:14.590 --> 04:17.230
Isn't the hero's job to protect us?!

04:17.230 --> 04:19.270
Hey, no worries.

04:19.810 --> 04:22.190
I'll do it for you.

04:24.980 --> 04:27.570
<i>Never thought I'd get my revenge
 this quickly.</i>

04:27.570 --> 04:28.850
<i>Talk about good luck!</i>

04:28.850 --> 04:30.620
Ein Grendel!

04:32.660 --> 04:35.700
If you lay a single finger on her...

04:36.430 --> 04:38.750
I'll kill you where you stand.

04:38.750 --> 04:40.170
Sir Touka!

04:38.750 --> 04:40.190
Touka!

04:40.190 --> 04:42.980
Is it true, then, that Yuna was...

04:42.980 --> 04:46.820
Mr. Hero! I thought you were here to save us!

04:47.300 --> 04:48.410
Shut up!

04:48.410 --> 04:51.460
Are you telling me if your
 loved ones turned into monsters,

04:51.460 --> 04:54.100
you'd be willing to kill 'em just like that?

04:54.100 --> 04:55.770
Well, not me!

04:56.180 --> 04:59.480
I'll protect Yuna, no matter 
who I have to fight to do it!

04:59.480 --> 05:02.690
Touka! Sheath your sword and calm yourself!

05:02.690 --> 05:04.280
You're against me too, Marguerite?!

05:04.280 --> 05:05.490
Of course not!

05:05.850 --> 05:07.820
But take a look around you!

05:07.820 --> 05:11.740
You're putting all of these people in danger!

05:13.200 --> 05:15.250
Why did you hide it from us?

05:15.250 --> 05:18.420
You must know that we would 
never abandon Dame Yuna.

05:19.180 --> 05:23.260
Sorry. I freaked myself out about it, and...

05:25.220 --> 05:26.300
Yuna!

05:27.430 --> 05:28.500
Stop it!

05:28.500 --> 05:29.740
It's too late!

05:29.740 --> 05:31.760
Someone kill her already!

05:31.760 --> 05:32.690
Touka!

05:32.690 --> 05:34.970
Stay back! You'll get bit!

05:34.970 --> 05:35.690
Yuna!

05:35.690 --> 05:38.020
Please, Yuna! Wake up!

05:40.000 --> 05:41.390
I'll give it a try.

05:41.390 --> 05:42.830
Ein Goedde!

05:49.710 --> 05:51.460
Sh-She stopped...

05:52.110 --> 05:54.540
Dame Yuna merely has a cold.

05:54.540 --> 05:55.710
Isn't that right?

05:56.770 --> 05:58.730
Whew, you scared me there!

05:58.730 --> 06:01.530
That wasn't funny at all, Mr. Hero!

06:03.960 --> 06:05.770
What's going on here, Anri?

06:05.770 --> 06:08.510
How can you control Yuna with necromancy?

06:08.510 --> 06:10.220
Don't tell me she's dea—

06:10.220 --> 06:13.030
No, look at Miss Yuna's head with this.

06:13.030 --> 06:14.470
It's Ein Bidiel.

06:19.260 --> 06:20.920
Ein Bidiel?

06:22.080 --> 06:24.330
I acquired this crystal in the capital.

06:24.330 --> 06:27.030
It lets you perceive others' mana levels.

06:27.030 --> 06:31.480
More precisely, it grants perception 
of formless things like mana and souls.

06:31.480 --> 06:35.370
I see Yuna's soul, mana wall, and...

06:35.370 --> 06:37.790
What's that wrapped around it?

06:37.790 --> 06:40.900
The spell responsible for 
the sudden change in her behavior.

06:40.900 --> 06:44.530
It's likely suppressing her soul, 
stripping away her reason,

06:44.530 --> 06:46.960
and making her act like a monster.

06:46.960 --> 06:51.430
Which means Yuna's still in there,
 and she's still alive?

06:51.430 --> 06:52.380
Indeed.

06:53.420 --> 06:54.740
I'm so glad.

06:55.260 --> 06:56.770
Then why'd the necromancy work?

06:56.770 --> 07:00.110
The spell seems to weaken the target's soul,

07:00.110 --> 07:03.650
leaving them in a corpse-like state.

07:03.650 --> 07:05.010
I'm so relieved it worked!

07:05.010 --> 07:07.110
You weren't <i>sure</i> it would?!

07:07.110 --> 07:09.240
If this is the doing of magic,

07:09.240 --> 07:11.970
then stealing or destroying
the caster's crystal

07:11.970 --> 07:13.650
should return Yuna to normal.

07:13.650 --> 07:14.850
You mean it?!

07:14.850 --> 07:18.140
Okay! Then let's find the caster, fast!

07:18.140 --> 07:19.080
Wait!

07:19.570 --> 07:23.420
It's not safe to go out in the dark 
with all those zombies around!

07:23.420 --> 07:26.550
It would be wise to be patient. 
We should wait until dawn.

07:26.550 --> 07:29.840
Can you really keep control 
of Yuna until then?

07:29.840 --> 07:33.760
It's true that I cannot use 
remote necromancy while asleep.

07:33.760 --> 07:37.720
So I shall use possession necromancy 
to take over her body.

07:38.280 --> 07:40.140
You're going to possess Yuna?

07:40.140 --> 07:44.230
If remote necromancy works, 
possession necromancy surely will as well.

07:44.230 --> 07:49.440
<b>Anri's Soul</b>

07:44.230 --> 07:49.440
<b>Yuna's Soul</b>

07:44.550 --> 07:49.440
I don't think the enemy's spell 
will take notice of my soul inside her,

07:49.440 --> 07:53.480
as two souls in one body 
is a most unusual circumstance.

07:55.530 --> 07:56.700
Anri.

07:57.380 --> 07:59.660
Let <i>me</i> possess Yuna.

08:00.160 --> 08:04.330
If you do it, you won't be able to 
use your remote necromancy, right?

08:04.330 --> 08:08.380
Indeed, I cannot use other forms 
of necromancy outside my own body.

08:08.380 --> 08:09.710
I figured as much.

08:09.710 --> 08:13.640
And since your remote necromancy 
works on infected people,

08:13.640 --> 08:16.220
having you possess someone else 
isn't a smart move.

08:16.220 --> 08:20.990
But with your mana level, you won't be 
able to withstand possession necromancy.

08:20.990 --> 08:23.810
I'll use some soma drops, then!

08:23.810 --> 08:26.390
You can't! They're far too precious!

08:26.390 --> 08:29.210
Aren't you a princess? 
How'd you get so stingy?

08:29.210 --> 08:32.650
What's the point in having a bunch 
left over after we save the world?

08:33.030 --> 08:35.450
But I could possess Yuna as well!

08:35.450 --> 08:40.950
And if someone who knows Yuna happens to 
show up, could you play her effectively?

08:40.950 --> 08:42.560
Well, I could!

08:42.560 --> 08:45.370
I know everything about her.

08:45.370 --> 08:46.380
Don't worry.

08:46.380 --> 08:48.340
I've got no ulterior motives here!

08:48.340 --> 08:50.040
You gotta trust me.

08:50.040 --> 08:52.780
This is the best way to save Yuna!

08:54.400 --> 08:55.410
Very well.

08:55.410 --> 08:57.380
I'll allow you to possess her.

08:58.970 --> 09:00.430
Are you ready?

09:00.430 --> 09:01.520
Yeah.

09:02.300 --> 09:03.980
<i>Possession necromancy!</i>

09:09.210 --> 09:10.480
Are you all right?

09:16.060 --> 09:17.320
I'm just fine.

09:17.320 --> 09:18.850
It went off without a hitch.

09:18.850 --> 09:21.540
Gonna take some getting used to, though.

09:22.780 --> 09:25.500
<i>Now Yuna's thighs belong to me!</i>

09:25.500 --> 09:27.710
Touka! What are you doing?!

09:27.710 --> 09:30.760
Uh, just checking for any more bite marks!

09:30.760 --> 09:33.830
I haven't discovered any injuries yet, but...

09:33.830 --> 09:35.240
Oh, I see.

09:35.240 --> 09:37.930
I thought for a moment you 
had more illicit intentions...

09:38.890 --> 09:40.410
Marguerite.

09:40.410 --> 09:44.680
You really think I'd do something 
so lousy in this situation?

09:44.680 --> 09:47.250
I'm just doing this to protect Yuna!

09:47.970 --> 09:50.020
F-Forgive me.

09:50.020 --> 09:52.940
<i>That was close! Be careful, dude!</i>

09:52.940 --> 09:55.400
<i>You'll get your chance for
a nice long look at her thighs later!</i>

09:55.400 --> 09:57.740
<i>Be subtle. Be natural...</i>

09:57.740 --> 10:01.850
Well, guess I better take a bath before bed!

10:01.850 --> 10:04.410
All that running's worked up a sweat!

10:04.410 --> 10:06.120
<i>That should do it!</i>

10:06.120 --> 10:07.530
Oh, in that case...

10:08.700 --> 10:11.080
Hey, what's all this?

10:11.080 --> 10:14.860
I thought Yuna would be embarrassed 
to learn that you bathed her.

10:14.860 --> 10:17.010
So we'll scrub you up and down!

10:17.010 --> 10:20.650
<i>Damn it! I can't see her thighs 
with this blindfold on!</i>

10:20.650 --> 10:21.470
Eek!

10:21.470 --> 10:23.030
Are you all right?

10:23.030 --> 10:24.860
Did we aggravate your injury?

10:24.860 --> 10:27.640
Nah, I'm okay...

10:27.640 --> 10:29.400
<i>What's with this sensation?!</i>

10:29.400 --> 10:31.500
<i>Is this what a woman's body is like?</i>

10:31.500 --> 10:33.410
<i>Man, this is way over the top!</i>

10:34.360 --> 10:36.100
A-Aren't you scrubbing a little hard?

10:36.100 --> 10:39.220
It's the only way to get the dirt off.

10:39.860 --> 10:42.940
<i>I can't enjoy Yuna's thighs like this!</i>

10:42.940 --> 10:45.230
Stop it, you guys!

10:45.230 --> 10:46.660
Oh, don't be shy!

10:46.660 --> 10:49.450
You'll feel much better with 
all the sweat washed off!

10:50.710 --> 10:53.880
<i>Damn, I couldn't even focus on her thighs!</i>

10:54.290 --> 10:56.590
Shall we get some rest, then?

10:57.040 --> 11:00.480
The mayor reserved us each a room.

11:04.320 --> 11:06.080
<i>At last!</i>

11:06.640 --> 11:09.290
<i>Yuna's thighs are all mine!</i>

11:10.600 --> 11:12.780
<i>Who is it now?!</i>

11:15.020 --> 11:16.860
Wh-What now?

11:16.860 --> 11:21.610
We decided it might be best to 
sleep in the same room, just in case.

11:21.610 --> 11:23.890
But you can't share a room with a guy!

11:23.890 --> 11:26.260
I feel safe with you, Sir Touka!

11:26.260 --> 11:30.700
And... I... have no objection either.

11:30.700 --> 11:33.960
After all, you're currently in Yuna's body.

11:37.140 --> 11:38.740
<i>The hell is this situation?</i>

11:41.810 --> 11:44.640
<i>Wait, duh! Talk about a lucky break!</i>

11:45.080 --> 11:49.600
<i>I can enjoy Yuna's and Marguerite's 
thighs at the same time!</i>

11:49.600 --> 11:52.600
<b>Faromian Binding Technique:
Instant Binding</b>

11:51.010 --> 11:51.810
Huh?

11:52.600 --> 11:55.310
A natural part of a princess's education.

11:55.310 --> 11:57.440
Wh-Why?

11:57.890 --> 12:01.280
I wish to protect Yuna 
just as much as you do.

12:01.280 --> 12:03.030
What?!

12:04.830 --> 12:06.740
Hey! Look!

12:20.220 --> 12:21.470
It's begun.

12:21.470 --> 12:23.030
What was that sound?!

12:24.660 --> 12:26.720
The wall has been destroyed!

12:26.720 --> 12:28.250
Hey, Anri, wake up!

12:28.250 --> 12:29.830
We're under attack!

12:30.720 --> 12:33.390
Wake the hell up, damn it!

12:35.420 --> 12:36.630
This way!

12:38.550 --> 12:41.110
They finally made it in, eh?

12:43.400 --> 12:45.780
This should liven things up a bit.

12:45.780 --> 12:47.230
Hey, don't kill them!

12:47.230 --> 12:49.690
They can still be returned to normal.

12:49.690 --> 12:50.830
Oh, really?

12:51.650 --> 12:54.000
Whoops! That was my double.

12:54.000 --> 12:56.460
Touching it will give you a shock.

12:58.920 --> 13:01.920
Don't worry. He's not dead... probably.

13:02.280 --> 13:06.640
Anyway, wanna get a load 
of the mayor in the throes of despair...

13:06.640 --> 13:08.140
Neigan?

13:10.460 --> 13:12.180
I'm too sleepy, Sir Touka.

13:12.180 --> 13:14.120
Quit sulking!

13:15.140 --> 13:18.610
See? They made it all the way 
here 'cause you're so slow!

13:18.610 --> 13:19.800
There are so many.

13:19.800 --> 13:23.570
It will be difficult to break through 
without harming them.

13:24.440 --> 13:26.000
<i>Remote necromancy!</i>

13:27.030 --> 13:29.370
I can hold them with necromancy.

13:31.330 --> 13:33.290
Found you!

13:33.290 --> 13:35.480
Please, help me!

13:36.580 --> 13:38.340
You need help?

13:38.340 --> 13:41.100
I thought you said this mansion was safe!

13:41.100 --> 13:42.950
There's a safe place close to here!

13:42.950 --> 13:44.420
I'll show you the way!

13:45.960 --> 13:47.380
Not good! That's a devil!

13:47.380 --> 13:48.510
We need to save him!

13:48.510 --> 13:50.080
Save him?

13:50.080 --> 13:53.100
Stop joking around, Neigan.

13:53.100 --> 13:55.690
That's the legendary hero's job.

13:55.690 --> 13:57.810
Hey! Someone's in trouble!

13:57.810 --> 14:00.050
We're too far away to help him!

14:00.050 --> 14:02.360
Don't worry. We can make it.

14:03.250 --> 14:05.990
The magic crystal for shooting chunks of ice?

14:05.990 --> 14:08.030
But it isn't very powerful, is it?

14:08.030 --> 14:10.730
No, which is why I'll use this.

14:11.950 --> 14:17.160
This enchanted bow can concentrate 
spell effects into arrows.

14:18.100 --> 14:19.680
Ein Fleurety!

14:26.510 --> 14:28.010
I'm saved...

14:29.320 --> 14:32.220
Is there really somewhere safe to go?

14:32.220 --> 14:34.680
Yes. It's this way!

14:44.820 --> 14:47.150
You made it, impostor hero.

14:47.500 --> 14:50.860
Don't tell me <i>he's</i> our safety net.

14:50.860 --> 14:53.070
I see. Is it finally my—

14:53.070 --> 14:55.440
Nah, he's got nothing to do with anything.

14:55.830 --> 14:57.380
It's that room there!

15:09.130 --> 15:12.670
Well? What do you think 
of my steel-reinforced room?!

15:12.670 --> 15:14.350
It's even got cannons!

15:14.350 --> 15:15.350
That's right!

15:15.350 --> 15:17.810
We can mount attacks in any direction!

15:22.520 --> 15:23.650
You see?

15:23.650 --> 15:26.270
Idiot! Now they know right where we are!

15:26.270 --> 15:28.620
So what if they do?

15:28.620 --> 15:32.110
We're totally safe in this room!

15:32.110 --> 15:34.870
Did you forget they breached the wall?

15:34.870 --> 15:37.520
Even if we're safe, we're the only ones left!

15:41.700 --> 15:43.640
It's all over!

15:43.640 --> 15:45.640
<i>This mayor really sucks.</i>

15:45.640 --> 15:50.250
I first heard the news three days ago. 
Only a few people were affected...

15:50.250 --> 15:55.320
But I did nothing to stop it
and let life go on as always.

15:55.320 --> 16:00.810
I never thought it would turn 
into a crisis in just a few days!

16:01.300 --> 16:03.390
There's nothing to worry about.

16:04.770 --> 16:07.720
We shall return them all to normal.

16:08.230 --> 16:09.820
Wait, you...

16:09.820 --> 16:11.350
Aren't you...

16:11.350 --> 16:12.650
the princess?

16:12.650 --> 16:14.980
O-Of course not!

16:14.980 --> 16:16.500
Pure mistaken identity.

16:16.500 --> 16:19.320
I'm sure you don't remember me,

16:19.320 --> 16:22.370
but we met once when you were very young.

16:22.750 --> 16:25.330
I would never mistake that beauty mark!

16:25.330 --> 16:27.090
<b>Faromian Ultimate Disguise Technique:
Mole Clone Technique</b>

16:25.330 --> 16:27.090
I have another over here!

16:28.350 --> 16:31.550
Oh, excuse me! I suppose it's 
mistaken identity after all.

16:31.550 --> 16:32.010
She drew it on.

16:32.010 --> 16:33.480
Totally drew it on.

16:33.480 --> 16:35.890
Wait, so that's really her?

16:35.890 --> 16:39.340
A-Anyway, if there are 
devils attacking as well,

16:39.340 --> 16:45.040
is it possible that a devil is also 
behind the spell affecting the townspeople?

16:45.040 --> 16:46.060
Indeed.

16:46.060 --> 16:50.900
And a spell of this scale suggests 
a high-rank one, at that.

16:51.330 --> 16:52.860
A high-rank devil?

16:52.860 --> 16:56.820
If it's like the one we fought 
in the capital, this is gonna be tricky...

16:56.820 --> 16:57.820
Wait.

16:57.820 --> 17:01.750
Anri, did you grab Leland's 
X-ray spell crystal?

17:01.750 --> 17:02.630
I did.

17:04.830 --> 17:06.540
Ein Togras!

17:06.850 --> 17:07.880
Touka?!

17:07.880 --> 17:09.510
This is hardly the time or place!

17:09.510 --> 17:10.730
U-Uh, my mistake!

17:10.730 --> 17:13.210
I meant to search for the devil!

17:15.020 --> 17:17.080
Still, it's pretty tricky...

17:17.080 --> 17:21.230
If I use too much mana, 
I see through <i>everything</i>...

17:21.600 --> 17:25.060
Hang on. What if I use it 
with the mana-seeing crystal?

17:25.590 --> 17:26.490
That'll do!

17:26.490 --> 17:28.690
Now I can see where they all are!

17:28.690 --> 17:30.270
Very impressive, Sir Touka!

17:30.710 --> 17:33.740
I can make out three nonhumans for sure.

17:34.180 --> 17:36.820
Is the brightest one a high-rank devil?

17:37.200 --> 17:39.900
A quick glance around revealed three devils.

17:39.900 --> 17:42.370
We've got the four of us,

17:42.370 --> 17:43.580
the two of them,

17:43.580 --> 17:44.790
and the mayor.

17:44.790 --> 17:46.280
That's seven of us in total.

17:46.280 --> 17:49.000
Hey. You forgot about me.

17:49.000 --> 17:53.460
If we know where they are,
we can come up with an ambush, right?

17:53.460 --> 17:55.460
Huh? Why should we help?

17:55.460 --> 17:58.050
Sorry, but we're not a part of this!

17:58.050 --> 17:59.480
By the way, aren't you...

17:59.480 --> 18:02.560
<i>Crud! She </i>does<i> remember us from the capital!</i>

18:02.560 --> 18:04.520
Look, it wasn't my fault!

18:04.520 --> 18:06.850
I was just following Leland's orders!

18:07.340 --> 18:08.720
As I thought...

18:08.720 --> 18:11.800
You were working with Leland, then?

18:11.800 --> 18:14.190
Y-Yeah...

18:14.190 --> 18:16.570
I guess that means
you really are the princess.

18:17.490 --> 18:19.610
What are you gonna do about it?

18:20.110 --> 18:26.080
Your involvement in the capital 
incident is absolutely unforgivable.

18:26.080 --> 18:28.100
But desperate times call 
for desperate measures.

18:28.100 --> 18:31.030
We need every set of hands available.

18:31.030 --> 18:34.100
If you help us save this town,

18:34.100 --> 18:38.410
I shall use my authority 
to guarantee you clemency.

18:39.350 --> 18:40.870
I-I...

18:41.590 --> 18:44.180
If she's giving us a chance to atone,

18:44.710 --> 18:46.180
I think we'd better take it.

18:48.390 --> 18:50.600
Yeah, yeah, I get it.

18:50.600 --> 18:52.860
We just gotta help, right?

18:58.830 --> 18:59.870
Below us!

19:04.950 --> 19:06.930
They attacked from below?

19:06.930 --> 19:08.620
How'd they know where we were?!

19:08.620 --> 19:11.160
Because you fired that damn cannon!

19:11.680 --> 19:13.420
Sion the hero...

19:13.420 --> 19:15.140
So you <i>are</i> here.

19:19.340 --> 19:20.680
I've done it.

19:21.850 --> 19:23.140
It's not an issue.

19:23.140 --> 19:26.280
He can regenerate from standard attacks.

19:26.870 --> 19:28.270
It didn't work?

19:28.270 --> 19:29.930
Why didn't it work?

19:37.770 --> 19:40.040
It blows up anything it touches!

19:41.250 --> 19:42.280
Not good!

19:43.240 --> 19:45.270
Marguerite!

19:46.280 --> 19:51.870
<b>Faromian Undressing Technique:
Molted Shell</b>

19:48.710 --> 19:51.870
If not for Isaac's teachings, 
I could have died there!

19:51.870 --> 19:53.830
The hell was that old man thinking?!

19:53.830 --> 19:55.210
<i>But thanks, bro!</i>

19:55.560 --> 19:57.920
Damn it! Let's get outside for now!

20:03.890 --> 20:06.880
Sorry, that was my double.

20:06.880 --> 20:08.680
There's one down.

20:08.680 --> 20:10.100
You okay?

20:10.100 --> 20:11.020
Yes.

20:11.020 --> 20:14.500
A true princess must be capable 
of enduring far greater levels of shame!

20:14.500 --> 20:17.730
Your <i>lack</i> of shame seems 
pretty unprincesslike to me!

20:17.730 --> 20:22.820
To survive an explosion spell,
it must be pretty tough.

20:23.620 --> 20:25.320
I'll take care of this one...

20:25.320 --> 20:27.210
by sending it to the next world.

20:27.210 --> 20:28.380
You'll "take care of it"?

20:28.380 --> 20:30.320
It's already on its last legs!

20:33.960 --> 20:35.500
They're turning on each other?

20:35.500 --> 20:36.940
No, that must be...

20:42.260 --> 20:43.850
On its last legs, my ass!

20:43.850 --> 20:45.720
It's alive and kicking!

20:47.180 --> 20:49.480
Its behavior is totally different now!

20:49.480 --> 20:50.370
Could it be...

20:50.370 --> 20:51.980
Indeed, no doubt about it.

20:51.980 --> 20:54.970
This is the same spell
affecting the townspeople!

20:54.970 --> 20:58.050
So that high-rank devil is the caster?!

20:59.440 --> 21:03.150
Anri, enlarge the hero's sword 
and crush the damn thing!

21:03.150 --> 21:04.440
Very well!

21:06.280 --> 21:08.170
What? It's not working.

21:08.170 --> 21:09.450
Don't be stupid!

21:09.450 --> 21:12.080
You just gotta imagine it getting big.

21:12.080 --> 21:14.910
That's what I'm doing, but it's not working.

21:14.910 --> 21:16.330
Here, let me show you.

21:17.150 --> 21:22.130
Just stick the thing out 
and imagine it growing.

21:24.970 --> 21:26.580
See? Easy.

21:26.580 --> 21:28.850
Wow! Very impressive, Sir Touka!

21:29.220 --> 21:31.780
Why can you use the Sacred Sword?

21:32.310 --> 21:33.790
What do you mean?

21:33.790 --> 21:36.440
I've been using it this whole damn time.

21:36.440 --> 21:40.750
But you're currently in Yuna's body.

21:41.840 --> 21:43.220
Hey, you're right.

21:43.890 --> 21:45.070
What's that about?

21:45.150 --> 21:56.160
<b>Next Time</b>

21:46.110 --> 21:56.160
<b>A New Legendary Hero</b>

23:16.760 --> 23:18.530
Hey. You all right?

23:21.860 --> 23:23.210
I'm fine.

23:23.210 --> 23:26.170
I think you were carried here from the city.

23:26.170 --> 23:30.630
The people there have 
all turned into monsters.

23:30.630 --> 23:31.990
I see.

23:31.990 --> 23:34.610
Well, I guess I'd better do something.

23:35.200 --> 23:38.190
After all, I'm the legendary hero!
